<http://tool4boxology.org/Boxology/graphrag-example> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "The workflow describes a simplified event information chatbot based on the GraphRAG approach." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Boxology/graphrag-example> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#context> "The system will be used in a demonstration environment (not real-world use case) to showcase RAG systems for potential users." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/risk_leakage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Risk> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/risk_leakage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk: Information Leakage" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/risk_leakage> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Private information stored in the KG may be leaked out." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/risk_malicious> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Risk> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/risk_malicious> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk: Malicious Knowledge Injection" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/risk_malicious> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Malicious Knowledge Injection to produce malicious prompt." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/risk_context> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Risk> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/risk_context> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk: Context too long" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/risk_context> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "The length of the prompt is above the allowed threshold." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/risk_halluc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Risk> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/risk_halluc> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk: Hallucination" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/risk_halluc> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "The answers from the chatbot deviate from the truth." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/rc_exclusion> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#RiskControl> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/rc_exclusion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk Control: Exclusion of sensitive data" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/rc_exclusion> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Sensitive data is filtered out during the construction of the KG." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/rc_dqc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#RiskControl> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/rc_dqc> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk Control: Data Quality Control" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/rc_dqc> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Sanitize query results." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/rc_warning> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#RiskControl> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/rc_warning> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk Control: Warning in Flow Editor" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/rc_warning> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Display a descriptive warning message in the demonstration." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/rs_insuf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#RiskSource> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/rs_insuf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk Source: Insufficient Information for Event Summarization" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/rs_insuf> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "The resulted KG subgraph does not contain enough information." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/consequence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Consequence> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/consequence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Consequence: Offensive Behaviour" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/consequence> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "The answers from the chatbot contain offensive content." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/impact_offended> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Impact> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/impact_offended> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Impact: Offended Users" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/impact_offended> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "The users are offended by the chatbot's responses, causing a bad impression of the showcased system." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/impact_cost> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Impact> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/impact_cost> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Impact: Cost Overrun" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/impact_cost> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "The cost for running the query is higher than the ChatBot service fee." .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/impact_rep> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/beam/risk#Impact> .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/impact_rep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Impact: Reputational Damage" .
<http://tool4boxology.org/Annotation/graphrag-example/impact_rep> <http://w3id.org/beam/core#description> "Reputational damage for the ChatBot provider and its clients." .
